     3141        ed-doc-type AT ROW 9.19 COL 16.8 NO-LABEL
     3142        bt-sel-doc-type AT ROW 9.19 COL 53.2
     3143        ed-doc-type-label AT ROW 9.24 COL 3 NO-LABEL
     3144        tb-inkass-pay-code AT ROW 11.48 COL 2.6
     3145        tb-deleted AT ROW 11.52 COL 36.6
